            <ArticleTitle>Psychosomatic treatment of phantom limb pain with post-traumatic stress disorder: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>385-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The successful treatment of severe left lower limb phantom pain is reported. Hypnosis and antidepressant drugs were the basis for the treatment which controlled the phantom limb pain and an associated post-traumatic stress disorder.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
